        "kind": "ClarificationQuestion",
        "content": "“整理”具体包括哪些工作：分类、归位、搬运、清理、贴标、盘点，还是其他操作？",
        "created_at_ms": 1789140465723,
        "in_reply_to": null
      },
      {
        "turn_id": "turn-0003",
        "speaker": "MissionIntelligence",
        "kind": "ClarificationQuestion",
        "content": "整理范围是整个仓库，还是指定区域、货架或通道？",
        "created_at_ms": 1789140465723,
        "in_reply_to": null
