      {
        "turn_id": "turn-0005",
        "speaker": "MissionIntelligence",
        "kind": "ClarificationQuestion",
        "content": "需要多少个执行者或机器人参与，是否允许人工协同？",
        "created_at_ms": 1789140465723,
        "in_reply_to": null
      },
      {
        "turn_id": "turn-0006",
        "speaker": "MissionIntelligence",
        "kind": "ClarificationQuestion",
        "content": "是否有安全或操作限制，例如禁止移动、丢弃或拆卸某些物品，或需避开人员、危险品和易碎品？",
